                "text": "The Biden-Harris administration has weaponized federal agencies to punish political opponents and censor speech on everything from elections to public health. @Weaponization isn\u2019t stopping our investigations to expose this corruption and censorship.\n\nWith @realDonaldTrump back in the White House, we can dismantle this culture of corruption and restore accountability in our government.",
