                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I filed a discharge petition for the bipartisan Sunshine Protection Act introduced by @VernBuchanan, which aims to make Daylight Saving Time permanent nationwide.\n\nChanging clocks is an outdated and disruptive ritual.\nPermanent DST brings better health, safer roads, lower crime, and a stronger economy.\n\nIt's time to lock the clock and keep our extra sunshine year-round for the benefit of all Americans.\n\nl urge all my colleagues to sign on!\n\n\ud83d\udd17https://t.co/0UOQuW6mXn",
