                "reply_count": 12,
                "retweet_count": 15,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I just introduced the Women\u2019s Protection in Telehealth Act to prevent taxpayer dollars from subsidizing providers who prescribe abortion-inducing drugs without in-person medical oversight.\n\nThis bill permanently excludes these providers from Medicare to protect women\u2019s health and halt the unchecked expansion of abortion via telehealth.\n\nThe Biden administration removed safeguards, allowing mail-order abortion pills with zero in-person medical requirements. It\u2019s time to stop this dangerous policy and protect both women and the unborn.\nhttps://t.co/tYfzbwHexM",
                "text_lang": "en",
