                "quoted_status_profile_username": "JakeSherman",
                "reply_count": 7,
                "retweet_count": 11,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Democrats have gone from deceit and deception to deadlock and dysfunction.\n\nAs border security collapsed and inflation skyrocketed, they bragged about Bidenomics and ignored the suffering of working-class communities.\n\nWhen concerns were raised about Biden\u2019s declining health, they gaslit the public and peddled \u201ccheap fake\u201d narratives to the press.\n\nNow, Democrats are fighting among themselves about this CR\u2014some eager to shut the government down while others flip-flop to avoid an electoral disaster.\n\nNo logo and rebranding effort can hide who the Democrats have become: the party of deadlock and dysfunction.",
