                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "At last week\u2019s Ways and Means Health Subcommittee hearing, I spoke with Dr. Jackie Gerhart about how we can solve the many challenges Florida providers face with electronic health records.\n\nFloridians deserve solutions that deliver affordable and reliable health technology to rural and underserved communities. I won\u2019t stop fighting until we get it done.",
